      "id": 1026,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 740,
      "y": 732,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 32,
      "text": "HOW THEY COORDINATE  (no leader)\n\nBlackboard - env.shared:\n   one shared map. Post where you are,\n   claim the cell you are about to enter\n   so no one else grabs it.\n\nScent - env.trail:\n   drop a marker others follow / avoid.\n   It fades over time (like ants).\n\nCrowding - env.near:\n   feel how many robots are next to you,\n   then spread out.",
      "originalText": "HOW THEY COORDINATE  (no leader)\n\nBlackboard - env.shared:\n   one shared map. Post where you are,\n   claim the cell you are about to enter\n   so no one else grabs it.\n\nScent - env.trail:\n   drop a marker others follow / avoid.\n   It fades over time (like ants).\n\nCrowding - env.near:\n   feel how many robots are next to you,\n   then spread out.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": 1025,
